{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/layouts"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Colored-Surface","text":"Colored Surface"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"title":"Orange","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Orange Compact","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Sosh","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Wireframe","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Colored backgrounds use surface colors to maximize the contrast with content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The colors of several OUDS components (for instance ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink"},{"text":") are automatically adjusted if they are placed on ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do so, some tokens associated with these specific colors can be customized and are identified with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Mono","type":"text"}]},{"text":" suffix (for instance ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"colorBgDefaultEnabledMono"}]},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"How-it-works","level":4,"type":"heading","text":"How it works"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"According to the color, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" component adds in SwiftUI environment two flags:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oudsUseMonochrome"},{"type":"text","text":": to inform a component that needs to use mono version of tokens"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oudsOnColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":": to inform a component it is placed on colored surface even if the mono is off"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"How-to-use","level":4,"type":"heading","text":"How to use"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ The folowing view has a colored background \"onStatusPositiveEmphasized\" with","    \/\/ - a text with the color adapted according to the adjusted colorScheme      ","    \/\/ - a button that uses the mono version of tokens","","    \/\/ As view","    OUDSColoredSurface(color: theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized) {","        VStack {","            Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","            .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","            OUDSButton(text: \"Button\") {}","        }","    }","","    \/\/ As view modifier","","    VStack {","        Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","        .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","        OUDSButton(text: \"Button\") {}","    }","    .coloredSurface(theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized)"]},{"anchor":"Debuging-contrast-ratios","level":4,"type":"heading","text":"Debuging contrast ratios"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/"},{"type":"text","text":", also named “RGAA”."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is highly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for texts and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some components like "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be used on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ; thus in that case we can know the surface color for a given component on it, and compute the contrast ratio, and in the end display or not warnings."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To do that, some steps must be followed in your component implementation:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rise the flag to allow debugging (e.g. i #DEBUG mode)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get the environment variable defined by the colored surface containing the applied color"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In the component implementation, add a line of code comparing the color to test and that surface","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then keep an eye on your logs ; warnings will be added there if WCAG 2.1 3:1, 4.5:1 or 7:1 ratios are not reached, depending to the methods you call"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"code":["\/\/ Rise the flag","#if DEBUG","OUDSWCAG21Ratios.oudsDebugWCAG21Colors = true","#endif","","\/\/ Supposing we are in your component View \/ ViewModifer struct","","\/\/ Get the applied surface color","@Environment(\\.oudsSurfaceColor) var surfaceColor","","\/\/ In the function defining the color to apply, add the line below","\/\/ where colorTokenToApply is the color to apply from a theme:","","\/\/ Non-textual components, in AA","OUDSWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .nonTextual)","","\/\/ Textual components and AAA to check","OUDSWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .AAA)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Divider","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Divider"},{"anchor":"How-it-works","level":4,"type":"heading","text":"How it works"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A divider is used to separate content elements in a view. Two kinds of divider are proposed:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": to separate elements stacked vertically (e.g. in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VStack"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSVerticalDivider","type":"reference"},{"text":": to separate elements stacked horizontally (e.g. in `HStack)","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A divider can be colored using color enumerated in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSDividerColor"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Horizontal","level":5,"type":"heading","text":"Horizontal"},{"tabs":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe"}]}],"title":"Wireframe"}],"type":"tabNavigator"},{"level":5,"text":"Vertical","anchor":"Vertical","type":"heading"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"title":"Orange","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Orange"}]}]},{"title":"Orange Compact","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Sosh","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Sosh"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe"}]}],"title":"Wireframe"}]},{"level":4,"text":"How to use","anchor":"How-to-use","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Add a vertical divider between items","HStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    OUDSVerticalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}","","\/\/ Add an horizontal divider between items","VStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    OUDSHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Layouts","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"Layouts","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"article","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some components can be used for "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"layouts"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"references":{"ic_folder_categories.png":{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png"}],"type":"image","alt":null},"component_verticalDivider_Sosh":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_Sosh.png"}],"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Sosh","type":"image","alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Sosh theme"},"component_coloredSurface_Orange":{"type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Orange theme","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Orange","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSDividerColor":{"title":"OUDSDividerColor","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSDividerColor","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSDividerColor","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsdividercolor","abstract":[{"text":"List of colors available for dividers (i.e. ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSVerticalDivider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh":{"type":"image","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Sosh.png"}],"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSHorizontalDivider":{"title":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudshorizontaldivider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Divider is a UI element that allows to structure the content by visually separating the content zones."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Divider improves readability and content organization without introducing a stronger visual hierarchy like a heading or a container would."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A horizontal Divider is used to separate content laid out one under the other ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VStack"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The divider can be colored using dedicated "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor"},{"type":"text","text":" colors."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The thickness (height) is fixed by dedicated token from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLink":{"title":"OUDSLink","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSLink","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLink","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslink","abstract":[{"text":"Link is a UI element that allows to navigate from one location to another, either within the same page or across different pages in the same resource,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or to an external resource.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Link’s primary function is navigation and it communicates its interactive nature visually and semantically.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"https://accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr/":{"type":"link","url":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/","title":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/"},"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe.png"}],"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe","type":"image","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme"},"component_coloredSurface_Sosh":{"type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Sosh","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Sosh.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSButton":{"kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSButton","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSButton","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbutton","abstract":[{"t